[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0010","text":"欢迎光临……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0020","text":"请慢用，旅途的疲惫……\n请来一块，甜美的樱饼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0000","text":"副导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0030","text":"卡！\n我确认一下哦"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0040","text":"……？\n甜花，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0050","text":"拍CM……\n好辛苦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0060","text":"确实……\n一大早就开始拍摄了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0070","text":"……对了，刚才工作人员说\n拍摄结束后准备了樱饼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0080","text":"把它当作奖励，再坚持一下怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0090","text":"……！\n嘿嘿……嗯……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31500200_01_0100","text":"甜花……\n为了樱饼，加油……！"}]
